		<Meldungstext>\T\L\S\K\ACompressor ON \L\B\K\N
 0\L\S\K\N		No shutoff requirement recognised\L\S\K\A

Compressor OFF \L\B\K\N
 1\L\S\K\N		Refrigerant pressure was or is too high\L\B\K\N
 2\L\S\K\N		Blower is defective\L\B\K\N
 3\L\S\K\N		refrigerant pressure was or is too low\L\B\K\N
 6	\L\S\K\N	A/C system switched off, ECON-mode\L\B\K\N
 7\L\S\K\N		A/C system switched off, OFF-mode \L\B\K\N
 8	\L\S\K\N	Outside temperature was less than 1.5°C and
 			is still less than 2.5 °C\L\B\K\N
 9\L\S\K\N		Blower switch in position 0\L\B\K\N
 10\L\S\K\N	Supply voltage T 15 &lt; 10.1V\L\B\K\N
 11\L\S\K\N	Coolant temperature warning lamp -K28-
 			is active\L\B\K\N
 13\L\S\K\N	Supply voltage T 15 &gt; 17V\L\B\K\N
 14\L\S\K\N	No signal or implausible signal from
 			Evaporator output temperature sender
 			-G263-\L\B\K\N
 16\L\S\K\N	Activation via -N280- compressor 
 			regulating valve is implausible\L\B\K\N
 17\L\S\K\N	No signal or implausible signal from
 			high pressure sender -G65\L\B\K\N
 18\L\S\K\N	Switchoff via onboard supply control unit</Meldungstext>
